      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING OSHAWA (1) finished fifth last time at Nowra but could not have been more impressive before that in her brilliant 20.49 win at Nowra over 365m. Rates a top chance if runs up to time two back. GATE TWO SLOY (8) is rarely out of the finish, recording nine places from 14 starts. Finished third (22.66) at Bulli latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expected to be in the finish again. BIG EDDIE (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing seventh (18.17) in a Grade 5 at Richmond Straight. Great chance to atone. IONA HUNTRIX (7) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
